# ═══ REAL-WORLD ACTION API KEYS (all free tiers) ═══════════════════════════
# Get these keys to unlock Otto's real-world capabilities.
# Each is free — no credit card needed (except Stripe which is free to create).

# Google Places API — for hotel_search + restaurant_search
# Get free: https://console.cloud.google.com/ → enable Places API → create API key
# Free tier: $200/month credit (enough for thousands of searches)
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Ticketmaster API — for event_search (concerts, sports, theater)
# Get free: https://developer.ticketmaster.com/ → register → get API key
# Free tier: 5000 calls/day
TICKETMASTER_API_KEY=

# Spotify API — for music_play (search songs, get previews)
# Get free: https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard/ → create app → get client ID + secret
# Free tier: unlimited searches, 30s previews
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Stripe — for payment_charge (charge cards, make purchases)
# Get free: https://dashboard.stripe.com/register → get test API key
# Free tier: test mode is unlimited (no real charges). Live mode charges per transaction.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=

# Uber API — for ride_estimate (price estimates)
# Get free: https://developer.uber.com/ → register → get API key
# Free tier: 5000 calls/month
UBER_API_KEY=

# Google Calendar API — for calendar_book (add events to calendar)
# Get free: https://console.cloud.google.com/ → enable Calendar API → create API key + OAuth
# Free tier: unlimited
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=

# ═══ COMMUNICATION API KEYS (optional, need real money) ═════════════════════
# These cost real money. Only add if you want Otto to send SMS/emails.

# Phone (Telnyx/Twilio/Vonage/Plivo) — for sms_send + voice calls
# Get: https://telnyx.com/ → sign up → buy a number ($1/mo) → get API key
# Cost: ~$1/mo per number + ~$0.004/SMS + ~$0.002/min voice
# Add in Settings → Phone inside the app (not here)

# Email (Resend/SendGrid/SMTP) — for email_send
# Get free: https://resend.com/ → sign up → get API key
# Free tier: 3000 emails/month, 100/day
# Add in Settings → Email inside the app (not here)
